A `.md` directory matches the pattern as a path but is no file, so it is skipped rather than
read: only the real file comes back, and the run stays quiet.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/notes.md/kept.md --
---
title: Inside the directory
---

body
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/mid.md --
---
title: Mid
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --glob 'plans/*.md' --columns slug
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
| slug | path |
| --- | --- |
| mid | plans/mid.md |
